  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1450",
    "text": "├─ pages publiques / diagnostic ── Cloudflare Pages",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1449",
    "text": "Architecture technique maître",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1461",
    "text": "bucket `project-documents` privé ;",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1455",
    "text": "Cloudflare sert vite un frontend statique mondial. Supabase reste l'unique autorité backend, ce qui évite de disperser secrets, validations et règles métier entre plusieurs runtimes.",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1457",
    "text": "code splitting par route à renforcer lors de l'intégration finale ;",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1462",
    "text": "Edge Functions pour lead public, création transactionnelle, liaison de lead, notifications, CRM et conversions ;",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1466",
    "text": "Frontière de confiance",
