    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1459",
    "text": "PostgreSQL comme source de vérité ;",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1454",
    "text": "Pourquoi cette séparation",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1464",
    "text": "Projet Supabase distinct, fausses données, Cloudflare branch `develop`.",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1465",
    "text": "Projet Supabase européen, données réelles, branche `main`, secrets dédiés, sauvegardes et monitoring.",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md:1456",
    "text": "Radix/shadcn à ajouter sélectivement si un composant complexe le justifie ;",
    "file": "docs/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md"
  },
